    "fullStory": "Kool's \"Celebration\" reached #1 on the Billboard Hot 100. \"Celebration\" is a song by American band Kool & the Gang.\n\nReleased in October 1980 by De-Lite Records as the first single from their twelfth album, Celebrate!.\n\n(1980), it was the band's first and only single to reach No.\n\nThe song peaked at #1 on the Billboard Hot 100 and spent 30 weeks on the chart.\n\nChart story — peaked at #1 on the Hot 100."
